s.az(0,"Tappable Body",new A.bnO(),"https://github.com/flame-engine/flame/blob/main/examples/lib/stories/bridge_libraries/flame_forge2d/tap_callbacks_example.dart","    In this example we show how to use Flame's TapCallbacks mixin to react to\n    taps on `BodyComponent`s.\n    Tap the ball to give it a random impulse, or the text to add an effect to\n    it.\n  ")
